That's inappropriate.

1050
00:52:28.780 --> 00:52:30.900
That's why I'm saying don't send them.

1051
00:52:31.260 --> 00:52:32.460
I don't want photos.

1052
00:52:32.640 --> 00:52:33.680
I don't want details.

1053
00:52:33.980 --> 00:52:34.620
Just tell me.

1054
00:52:34.860 --> 00:52:35.820
Oh, my God.

1055
00:52:36.000 --> 00:52:36.360
You guys.

1056
