But it is certainly, I don't think, the sushi capital.

1377
01:11:30.970 --> 01:11:33.750
But whatever, Michael is really, really bummed.

1378
01:11:34.070 --> 01:11:34.630
Yeah.

1379
01:11:34.750 --> 01:11:40.130
And he says to Dwight, I think we should go to New York and get that sushi.

1380
01:11:40.870 --> 01:11:41.790
You're driving.

1381
01:11:42.750 --> 01:11:44.150
Dwight is so excited.

1382
01:11:44.370 --> 01:11:45.590
He can't wait.

1383
01:11:45.870 --> 01:11:50.610
He can't wait to drive all the way to New York to crash the tail end of this corporate party

1384
01:11:50.610 --> 01:11:53.710
and get the leftover sushi that no one else wanted to eat.

1385
01:11:54.290 --> 01:11:55.990
That's been sitting out for a while.

1386
01:11:55.990 --> 01:11:57.250
For a long while.

1387
01:11:57.670 --> 01:11:58.930
I just want to say.

1388
01:11:59.210 --> 01:11:59.530
Mm-hmm.

1389
01:12:00.070 --> 01:12:01.330
So that's what they do.

1390
01:12:01.510 --> 01:12:02.150
They get there.

1391
01:12:02.350 --> 01:12:03.390
They go into the party.

1392
01:12:03.710 --> 01:12:05.870
They get kicked out pretty much immediately.

1393
01:12:05.870 --> 01:12:06.910
There's no one there.

1394
