But they grab a plate of sushi.

1395
01:12:08.890 --> 01:12:12.130
And then they go and they sit on the hood of Dwight's car.

1396
01:12:12.710 --> 01:12:15.890
And guys, this, they did not go to New York to shoot this.

1397
01:12:16.050 --> 01:12:21.410
Obviously, this is a little parking lot that they found in downtown LA, I believe.

1398
01:12:21.410 --> 01:12:24.390
I recognized it because I think I've shot there.

1399
01:12:24.810 --> 01:12:25.170
Mm-hmm.

1400
01:12:25.170 --> 01:12:29.090
They are just eating the sushi and they are making fun of Ryan.

1401
01:12:30.270 --> 01:12:36.250
And someone leaves the party and says to Michael, hey, that was pretty awesome, you know, when

1402
01:12:36.250 --> 01:12:37.690
you called Ryan out like that.

1403
01:12:37.890 --> 01:12:40.990
And it is, it's like all he needed, right?

1404
01:12:41.090 --> 01:12:41.230
Yeah.

1405
01:12:41.310 --> 01:12:42.430
He feels seen.

1406
01:12:42.770 --> 01:12:44.170
And they're having sushi.

1407
01:12:44.170 --> 01:12:45.430
And they're in New York.

1408
01:12:45.430 --> 01:12:46.830
And now he can go home.

1409
01:12:47.190 --> 01:12:47.670
Yeah.

1410
01:12:47.670 --> 01:12:55.030
He sets the tray of sushi and soy sauce on someone else's car and they go home.

1411
01:12:56.290 --> 01:12:57.570
It's pretty amazing.

1412
01:12:57.910 --> 01:12:59.970
And then we have just a little tag at the end.

1413
01:13:00.250 --> 01:13:07.750
We just see Ryan in full douche mode, winking at the camera from his New York party that's

1414
01:13:07.750 --> 01:13:08.630
in full swing.

1415
01:13:08.790 --> 01:13:09.310
Oh, yeah.

1416
01:13:09.450 --> 01:13:10.910
So pleased with himself.

1417
01:13:11.310 --> 01:13:15.730
Well, I don't know if you thought about it, but the scene had basically three couples

1418
01:13:15.730 --> 01:13:17.990
in it, having intimate moments.

1419
01:13:18.250 --> 01:13:21.070
We have Jim and Pam dinner on the roof.

1420
01:13:21.250 --> 01:13:24.950
We have Andy and Angela serenading and accounting.

1421
01:13:25.170 --> 01:13:28.750
And we have Michael and Dwight having dinner in a parking lot.

1422
01:13:29.310 --> 01:13:29.870
Yeah.

1423
01:13:31.310 --> 01:13:32.390
Very sweet.

1424
01:13:32.670 --> 01:13:33.550
Very sweet.

1425
01:13:33.930 --> 01:13:36.970
And we had one hostage, but we let him go.

1426
01:13:39.710 --> 01:13:44.110
Well, guys, that was lunch party part two.

